- id: '2098833601777344794'
  text: 'CHATGPT-6 ASTRA BUILT ME A TINY PLANET. NOW I RUN ITS AIRPORTS✈️


    7 islands, 3 airports, little towns, and planes flying around the world


    Board passengers, follow flights, build hangars, and switch to night mode. All
    running right in your browser with Three.js + WebGL


    I was only going to try one flight'
