  quotedTweet:
    id: '2098555819650601082'
    text: 'JUST LOOK AT THE PLANET I BUILT WITH CHATGPT-6 ASTRA🤯🌍


      This is Little Rail World - a tiny world with trains, bridges, forests, and
      little villages. And you can interact with it all right in your browser


      Spin the planet, pick a train, and hop aboard. Stop at a station, open the doors,
      and watch the passengers get on


      There are even freight trains: load up some sand, haul it across the planet,
      and unload it at another station


      Want to make it your own? Build cottages, plant trees, and add new stations


      All running right in your browser with Three.js + WebGL


      After this project, Astra is the strongest model out there for me right now.
      Claude isn’t even close yet'
    author:
      screenName: vib3coded
      name: Vib3Coded
